{"id":"since_rement","lemma":"sincèrement","pos":"adv","rank":2395,"glosses":["sincerely, truly","honestly, sincerely"],"ipa":"/sɛ̃.sɛʁ.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d0/Fr-sinc%C3%A8rement.ogg/Fr-sinc%C3%A8rement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je suis sincèrement désolé pour toi.","en":"I sincerely feel sorry for you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"sorry"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Je ne l'espère sincèrement pas.","en":"I sincerely hope not.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to hope","l":"espérer"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"J'en doute sincèrement.","en":"I sincerely doubt that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"doubt"},null]},{"text":"Tu dois répondre sincèrement.","en":"You must answer honestly.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to reply, to answer"},null]},{"text":"Je le pense sincèrement.","en":"I sincerely mean that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},null]}]}